   "ANSWER": "<p data-end=\"255\" data-start=\"212\">+5 in binary = 0101<br data-end=\"219\" data-start=\"216\" />\n-3 in binary = 1101 (2&rsquo;s complement of 0011)<br data-end=\"266\" data-start=\"263\" />\nAdd:</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"255\" data-start=\"212\">&nbsp; 0101 &nbsp;<br />\n+ 1101 &nbsp;<br />\n= 10010 &nbsp;<br />\nDiscard the carry (5th bit): result = 0010 = <strong data-end=\"359\" data-start=\"354\">2</strong></p>\n",
